TANE OS / RUST BARE METAL
Self-made BIOS loader + Rust kernel. External crates: 0.
64-bit mode | VGA + COM1 | PS/2 keyboard | no heap
RAM: 7 E820 entries | 16096 free 4 KiB frames (64384 KiB) above 1 MiB
IDT: 32 exception handlers, #DF on IST1 | PIT timer 100 Hz
Tasks: preemptive round robin, up to 8 tasks
Protection: NX data | kernel text read-only | null page unmapped | CR0.WP
MAC: enforcing compiled-in policy | shell domain admin (drop lowers it)
Disk: none (attach an IDE disk for TaneFS)
Network: RTL8139 MAC 52:54:00:12:34:56 | static IPv4 + IPv6
Type help. English keyboard / ASCII input.
READY
tane> net
RTL8139 I/O 0xc000 MAC 52:54:00:12:34:56
IPv4 10.0.2.15 mask 255.255.255.0 gateway 10.0.2.2
IPv6 fd00::15/64 gateway fd00::2
RX 0 TX 0 dropped 0 | 0 cached neighbors
Polling, MTU 1500, static addresses; 10 ms timer resolution
